hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18480","Abu Kamil narrated to us, Hammad ibn Zayd narrated to us, from Thabit al-Bunani, from Abi Burdah, from al-Agharr al-Muzani who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: My heart is clouded, and I seek Allahs forgiveness every day a hundred times."
"18481","Wahb narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, from Amr ibn Murrah, from Abi Burdah that he heard al-Agharr al-Muzani narrating to Ibn Umar from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) that he said: O people, repent to your Lord, for I repent to Allah, Mighty and Majestic, every day a hundred times."
